      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. the antihistamine is a good idea. but honestly the itch is fading and i feel fine now, just a bit of a racing heart like i've had too much coffee. i really need the energy for this session though. if i just take a smaller dose of the pre-workout instead of a full scoop, would that be okay? i feel like the caffeine will actually help me focus and get through the weird feeling.",
